      en: ["Maroc Phosphore is a key subsidiary of the state-owned OCP Group.", "The plant ranks among the world's largest producers of industrial phosphoric acid.", "The complex consists of multiple processing units, notably Maroc Phosphore I and II.", "Production involves using sulfuric acid to extract phosphoric acid from raw ore.", "A vast majority of the output is destined for export to European and Asian markets.", "The facility has pioneered innovative chemical processes for phosphate refinement."],
